  "source_title": "王承书\n她立下三份遗嘱，一份都没留给自己\n#王承书 #国之脊梁 #中国女科学家 #文字共鸣 #读书感悟 #情感共鸣 #家国情怀",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_1b23700d23e01086_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 396.851995,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "一九九四年六月十八日，北京，一位八十二岁的老太太走了，按她生前立的遗嘱后事是这么办的。第一，遗体不火化，直接捐给医学研究单位，可用的部分，充分利用。第二一辈子的书籍、笔记手稿全部打包送给核工业研究院。第三，存折摊开数一遍，零存整取的七千两百二十万二点八八元交最后一次党费，剩下约十万元，全部捐给希望工程三样遗体手稿存款一样不剩，全给了国家，自己一分没留葬礼，一个都不办。可你知道最扎心的是什么吗？这位把全部家当捐出去的老太太，不是没本事挣钱，她是中科院学部委员，核物理学家是美国顶尖学府，请走过的天才，是被西方媒体称为中国的居里夫人的人。他这辈子挣的每一分钱，最后都流出了自己的口袋。他这辈子出的每一个名最后都填进了国家的需要，他叫王成书聚集。我从他留下的三件遗物讲起，一物一一张发黄的纸条，整理他笔记本的人翻到的上面一行字，在无论任何条件下，坚决完成党交给我的任何任务，在必要时不惜牺牲自己的生命。这张纸条是一九六一年他入党那天写的童年，他从两百八十多块的月薪里直接抽出两百块交党费，剩下八十多块还要接济困难的人。党委同志劝他，王先生，你不能这么教，你还得过日子啊。他摇摇头，我既然入了党，就要给党做贡献。我用不了这么多钱，国家不用给我那么多钱，你听听两百八十块工资拿二百交党。对，这是什么觉悟？从那天起，他把名字藏了起来，把家撤了一头扎进大西北。干了一件不能说不能写，不能告诉任何人的事，一干就是三十年。他学生说了一句狠话，我的老师是那种死后既有资格见先烈，又有资格见同行的人。遗物。二，一副放大镜。一九八零年，他当选中科院学部委员植务，一路做到核工业部科学技术局总工程师。可了解。她的人都知道，这老太太有三样，不会有权，不会用，有钱，不会花有福，不会享先说，不会花钱，晚年患上白内障。医生说，打进口药，一支六百块，她乐呵呵摆手，你看我这双眼睛还值六千块吗？不治了。年近八十就靠一副放大镜批学生的论文，一个标点符号错了都不放过。三年期间的困难时期，学生们用的笔记本和铅笔全是他从工资里掏钱买的。再说他怎么浪费钱。一九八六年，一家三代纪念回国三十周年摆了一次小小的家宴。他当众说了一句话，让满桌人都沉默了，现在有人弃祖国而去，有人出国学习不愿回来。我这一生最后悔的事情，请就是回国太晚了，回国晚了，这四个字从一个被美国扣了七年，想尽一切办法才回来的。人口中说出来是什么分量，他后悔的不是回来，是回来的，太晚了，为国家干的时间太少了。一五三一个捐了两次款的存折。希望工程的捐款名单里，张文玉、王成书这两个名字出现了不止一次。一九九二年十一月，丈夫张文玉、中国高能物理学的开拓者、中科院学部委员积劳成疾，先走了。老两口早就有个约定，不给儿孙留遗产，全部积蓄，捐给国家的教育事业。送走丈夫王成书，转头把先生一辈子的积蓄十万元整捐给了希望。工臣在西藏日喀则萨迦县盖起一所小学，小名就用丈夫的名字。文艺小学第二年，他自知。时日无多，写下了本集开头那份遗嘱。他给学生写信说，我一生平淡无奇，只是踏踏实实的工作。至于说贡献，谁又没有贡献？为国家做贡献，是每一个公民的职责，何况是一个共产党员。你看把三次改行半生，引身全部身家都做完的人管，这叫平安平淡无奇。他这八十二年生前不能署名，死后不许办丧。他把名字还给了时代，把遗体还给了医学研究，把积蓄捐献给了孩子，连最后一点私心都没给自己留。今天我把这个名字还给他，王成书系列，到这就全部讲讲完了五一一个一辈子。如果你也为这个一分没留给自己的老人，动容，请做三件事，点赞、收藏、转发，让更多人看到评论区打上王成书三个字，这三个字，他低调了一辈子，我们替他大声说一次关注我，下一个国之脊梁。我们继续讲。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00001",
      "start_ms": 90,
      "end_ms": 1910,
      "text": "一九九四年六月十八日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1910,
      "end_ms": 2310,
      "text": "北京，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2670,
      "end_ms": 4890,
      "text": "一位八十二岁的老太太走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00004",
      "start_ms": 5370,
      "end_ms": 8770,
      "text": "按她生前立的遗嘱后事是这么办的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9130,
      "end_ms": 9610,
      "text": "第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00006",
      "start_ms": 9950,
      "end_ms": 11170,
      "text": "遗体不火化，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00007",
      "start_ms": 11650,
      "end_ms": 14050,
      "text": "直接捐给医学研究单位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00008",
      "start_ms": 14470,
      "end_ms": 15470,
      "text": "可用的部分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00009",
      "start_ms": 15770,
      "end_ms": 16730,
      "text": "充分利用。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00010",
      "start_ms": 17130,
      "end_ms": 24030,
      "text": "第二一辈子的书籍、笔记手稿全部打包送给核工业研究院。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00011",
      "start_ms": 24650,
      "end_ms": 25110,
      "text": "第三，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00012",
      "start_ms": 25410,
      "end_ms": 27150,
      "text": "存折摊开数一遍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00013",
      "start_ms": 27590,
      "end_ms": 32860,
      "text": "零存整取的七千两百二十万二点八八元交最后一次党费，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00014",
      "start_ms": 33300,
      "end_ms": 34660,
      "text": "剩下约十万元，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00015",
      "start_ms": 35440,
      "end_ms": 41420,
      "text": "全部捐给希望工程三样遗体手稿存款一样不剩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00016",
      "start_ms": 41880,
      "end_ms": 42920,
      "text": "全给了国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00017",
      "start_ms": 43160,
      "end_ms": 45260,
      "text": "自己一分没留葬礼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00018",
      "start_ms": 45500,
      "end_ms": 46319,
      "text": "一个都不办。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00019",
      "start_ms": 46840,
      "end_ms": 48900,
      "text": "可你知道最扎心的是什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00020",
      "start_ms": 49300,
      "end_ms": 52060,
      "text": "这位把全部家当捐出去的老太太，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00021",
      "start_ms": 52600,
      "end_ms": 54520,
      "text": "不是没本事挣钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00022",
      "start_ms": 55180,
      "end_ms": 57160,
      "text": "她是中科院学部委员，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00023",
      "start_ms": 57620,
      "end_ms": 61050,
      "text": "核物理学家是美国顶尖学府，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00024",
      "start_ms": 61090,
      "end_ms": 62475,
      "text": "请走过的天才，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00025",
      "start_ms": 63050,
      "end_ms": 67045,
      "text": "是被西方媒体称为中国的居里夫人的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00026",
      "start_ms": 67820,
      "end_ms": 69555,
      "text": "他这辈子挣的每一分钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00027",
      "start_ms": 70070,
      "end_ms": 71950,
      "text": "最后都流出了自己的口袋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00028",
      "start_ms": 71990,
      "end_ms": 76185,
      "text": "他这辈子出的每一个名最后都填进了国家的需要，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00029",
      "start_ms": 76750,
      "end_ms": 79115,
      "text": "他叫王成书聚集。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00030",
      "start_ms": 79450,
      "end_ms": 81915,
      "text": "我从他留下的三件遗物讲起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00031",
      "start_ms": 82680,
      "end_ms": 86725,
      "text": "一物一一张发黄的纸条，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00032",
      "start_ms": 87250,
      "end_ms": 90765,
      "text": "整理他笔记本的人翻到的上面一行字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00033",
      "start_ms": 91240,
      "end_ms": 92905,
      "text": "在无论任何条件下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00034",
      "start_ms": 93300,
      "end_ms": 95965,
      "text": "坚决完成党交给我的任何任务，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00035",
      "start_ms": 96450,
      "end_ms": 99415,
      "text": "在必要时不惜牺牲自己的生命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00036",
      "start_ms": 100040,
      "end_ms": 105745,
      "text": "这张纸条是一九六一年他入党那天写的童年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00037",
      "start_ms": 106100,
      "end_ms": 111530,
      "text": "他从两百八十多块的月薪里直接抽出两百块交党费，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00038",
      "start_ms": 111710,
      "end_ms": 115025,
      "text": "剩下八十多块还要接济困难的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00039",
      "start_ms": 116010,
      "end_ms": 117225,
      "text": "党委同志劝他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00040",
      "start_ms": 118040,
      "end_ms": 118685,
      "text": "王先生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00041",
      "start_ms": 119280,
      "end_ms": 120395,
      "text": "你不能这么教，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00042",
      "start_ms": 120710,
      "end_ms": 121915,
      "text": "你还得过日子啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00043",
      "start_ms": 122830,
      "end_ms": 123645,
      "text": "他摇摇头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00044",
      "start_ms": 124720,
      "end_ms": 125895,
      "text": "我既然入了党，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00045",
      "start_ms": 126560,
      "end_ms": 128545,
      "text": "就要给党做贡献。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00046",
      "start_ms": 129230,
      "end_ms": 130695,
      "text": "我用不了这么多钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00047",
      "start_ms": 131180,
      "end_ms": 132975,
      "text": "国家不用给我那么多钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00048",
      "start_ms": 133950,
      "end_ms": 138335,
      "text": "你听听两百八十块工资拿二百交党。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00049",
      "start_ms": 138490,
      "end_ms": 138655,
      "text": "对，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00050",
      "start_ms": 139560,
      "end_ms": 140545,
      "text": "这是什么觉悟？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00051",
      "start_ms": 141600,
      "end_ms": 142585,
      "text": "从那天起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00052",
      "start_ms": 143310,
      "end_ms": 144735,
      "text": "他把名字藏了起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00053",
      "start_ms": 145210,
      "end_ms": 148035,
      "text": "把家撤了一头扎进大西北。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00054",
      "start_ms": 148500,
      "end_ms": 150695,
      "text": "干了一件不能说不能写，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00055",
      "start_ms": 151020,
      "end_ms": 152560,
      "text": "不能告诉任何人的事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00056",
      "start_ms": 152680,
      "end_ms": 154505,
      "text": "一干就是三十年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00057",
      "start_ms": 155750,
      "end_ms": 157265,
      "text": "他学生说了一句狠话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00058",
      "start_ms": 158220,
      "end_ms": 162835,
      "text": "我的老师是那种死后既有资格见先烈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00059",
      "start_ms": 163530,
      "end_ms": 165995,
      "text": "又有资格见同行的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00060",
      "start_ms": 167640,
      "end_ms": 168060,
      "text": "遗物。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00061",
      "start_ms": 168060,
      "end_ms": 168365,
      "text": "二，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00062",
      "start_ms": 170010,
      "end_ms": 171195,
      "text": "一副放大镜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00063",
      "start_ms": 171800,
      "end_ms": 172780,
      "text": "一九八零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00064",
      "start_ms": 172780,
      "end_ms": 175850,
      "text": "他当选中科院学部委员植务，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00065",
      "start_ms": 175850,
      "end_ms": 179245,
      "text": "一路做到核工业部科学技术局总工程师。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00066",
      "start_ms": 180040,
      "end_ms": 180600,
      "text": "可了解。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00067",
      "start_ms": 180600,
      "end_ms": 181540,
      "text": "她的人都知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00068",
      "start_ms": 181680,
      "end_ms": 182880,
      "text": "这老太太有三样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00069",
      "start_ms": 182880,
      "end_ms": 184360,
      "text": "不会有权，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00070",
      "start_ms": 184520,
      "end_ms": 185080,
      "text": "不会用，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00071",
      "start_ms": 185500,
      "end_ms": 186040,
      "text": "有钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00072",
      "start_ms": 186140,
      "end_ms": 187780,
      "text": "不会花有福，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00073",
      "start_ms": 188060,
      "end_ms": 189680,
      "text": "不会享先说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00074",
      "start_ms": 189780,
      "end_ms": 190520,
      "text": "不会花钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00075",
      "start_ms": 191120,
      "end_ms": 192980,
      "text": "晚年患上白内障。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00076",
      "start_ms": 193000,
      "end_ms": 193580,
      "text": "医生说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00077",
      "start_ms": 193600,
      "end_ms": 194540,
      "text": "打进口药，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00078",
      "start_ms": 194720,
      "end_ms": 195720,
      "text": "一支六百块，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00079",
      "start_ms": 196440,
      "end_ms": 197640,
      "text": "她乐呵呵摆手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00080",
      "start_ms": 197800,
      "end_ms": 200820,
      "text": "你看我这双眼睛还值六千块吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00081",
      "start_ms": 201040,
      "end_ms": 201720,
      "text": "不治了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00082",
      "start_ms": 201940,
      "end_ms": 206140,
      "text": "年近八十就靠一副放大镜批学生的论文，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00083",
      "start_ms": 206740,
      "end_ms": 208840,
      "text": "一个标点符号错了都不放过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00084",
      "start_ms": 209990,
      "end_ms": 212030,
      "text": "三年期间的困难时期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00085",
      "start_ms": 212330,
      "end_ms": 217110,
      "text": "学生们用的笔记本和铅笔全是他从工资里掏钱买的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00086",
      "start_ms": 217969,
      "end_ms": 219810,
      "text": "再说他怎么浪费钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00087",
      "start_ms": 220410,
      "end_ms": 221610,
      "text": "一九八六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00088",
      "start_ms": 221950,
      "end_ms": 227350,
      "text": "一家三代纪念回国三十周年摆了一次小小的家宴。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00089",
      "start_ms": 227490,
      "end_ms": 228790,
      "text": "他当众说了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00090",
      "start_ms": 229210,
      "end_ms": 231370,
      "text": "让满桌人都沉默了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00091",
      "start_ms": 231830,
      "end_ms": 233690,
      "text": "现在有人弃祖国而去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00092",
      "start_ms": 233930,
      "end_ms": 235970,
      "text": "有人出国学习不愿回来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00093",
      "start_ms": 236710,
      "end_ms": 239780,
      "text": "我这一生最后悔的事情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00094",
      "start_ms": 239800,
      "end_ms": 241625,
      "text": "请就是回国太晚了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00095",
      "start_ms": 242190,
      "end_ms": 243135,
      "text": "回国晚了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00096",
      "start_ms": 243740,
      "end_ms": 247675,
      "text": "这四个字从一个被美国扣了七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00097",
      "start_ms": 248210,
      "end_ms": 250270,
      "text": "想尽一切办法才回来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00098",
      "start_ms": 250270,
      "end_ms": 252645,
      "text": "人口中说出来是什么分量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00099",
      "start_ms": 253180,
      "end_ms": 254795,
      "text": "他后悔的不是回来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00100",
      "start_ms": 255260,
      "end_ms": 255900,
      "text": "是回来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00101",
      "start_ms": 255900,
      "end_ms": 256575,
      "text": "太晚了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00102",
      "start_ms": 257520,
      "end_ms": 259505,
      "text": "为国家干的时间太少了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00103",
      "start_ms": 261090,
      "end_ms": 264995,
      "text": "一五三一个捐了两次款的存折。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00104",
      "start_ms": 266140,
      "end_ms": 268160,
      "text": "希望工程的捐款名单里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00105",
      "start_ms": 268160,
      "end_ms": 272195,
      "text": "张文玉、王成书这两个名字出现了不止一次。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00106",
      "start_ms": 272780,
      "end_ms": 274435,
      "text": "一九九二年十一月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00107",
      "start_ms": 274800,
      "end_ms": 282230,
      "text": "丈夫张文玉、中国高能物理学的开拓者、中科院学部委员积劳成疾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00108",
      "start_ms": 282230,
      "end_ms": 282775,
      "text": "先走了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00109",
      "start_ms": 283830,
      "end_ms": 285515,
      "text": "老两口早就有个约定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00110",
      "start_ms": 286270,
      "end_ms": 287685,
      "text": "不给儿孙留遗产，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00111",
      "start_ms": 288220,
      "end_ms": 289300,
      "text": "全部积蓄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00112",
      "start_ms": 289380,
      "end_ms": 291055,
      "text": "捐给国家的教育事业。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00113",
      "start_ms": 292010,
      "end_ms": 294500,
      "text": "送走丈夫王成书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00114",
      "start_ms": 294500,
      "end_ms": 299130,
      "text": "转头把先生一辈子的积蓄十万元整捐给了希望。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00115",
      "start_ms": 299150,
      "end_ms": 302995,
      "text": "工臣在西藏日喀则萨迦县盖起一所小学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00116",
      "start_ms": 303730,
      "end_ms": 305635,
      "text": "小名就用丈夫的名字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00117",
      "start_ms": 305940,
      "end_ms": 308375,
      "text": "文艺小学第二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00118",
      "start_ms": 308720,
      "end_ms": 309315,
      "text": "他自知。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00119",
      "start_ms": 309690,
      "end_ms": 310610,
      "text": "时日无多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00120",
      "start_ms": 310990,
      "end_ms": 313370,
      "text": "写下了本集开头那份遗嘱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00121",
      "start_ms": 313790,
      "end_ms": 315110,
      "text": "他给学生写信说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00122",
      "start_ms": 315570,
      "end_ms": 317430,
      "text": "我一生平淡无奇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00123",
      "start_ms": 317890,
      "end_ms": 319470,
      "text": "只是踏踏实实的工作。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00124",
      "start_ms": 320050,
      "end_ms": 321090,
      "text": "至于说贡献，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00125",
      "start_ms": 321590,
      "end_ms": 322770,
      "text": "谁又没有贡献？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00126",
      "start_ms": 323190,
      "end_ms": 324370,
      "text": "为国家做贡献，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00127",
      "start_ms": 324790,
      "end_ms": 326650,
      "text": "是每一个公民的职责，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00128",
      "start_ms": 327130,
      "end_ms": 328870,
      "text": "何况是一个共产党员。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00129",
      "start_ms": 329810,
      "end_ms": 334250,
      "text": "你看把三次改行半生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00130",
      "start_ms": 334350,
      "end_ms": 338870,
      "text": "引身全部身家都做完的人管，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00131",
      "start_ms": 338870,
      "end_ms": 340280,
      "text": "这叫平安平淡无奇。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00132",
      "start_ms": 340520,
      "end_ms": 343440,
      "text": "他这八十二年生前不能署名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00133",
      "start_ms": 343840,
      "end_ms": 345120,
      "text": "死后不许办丧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00134",
      "start_ms": 345640,
      "end_ms": 347400,
      "text": "他把名字还给了时代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00135",
      "start_ms": 347760,
      "end_ms": 350220,
      "text": "把遗体还给了医学研究，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00136",
      "start_ms": 350700,
      "end_ms": 353100,
      "text": "把积蓄捐献给了孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00137",
      "start_ms": 353440,
      "end_ms": 356440,
      "text": "连最后一点私心都没给自己留。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00138",
      "start_ms": 357160,
      "end_ms": 359320,
      "text": "今天我把这个名字还给他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00139",
      "start_ms": 359580,
      "end_ms": 360640,
      "text": "王成书系列，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00140",
      "start_ms": 360640,
      "end_ms": 365100,
      "text": "到这就全部讲讲完了五一一个一辈子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00141",
      "start_ms": 365540,
      "end_ms": 368420,
      "text": "如果你也为这个一分没留给自己的老人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00142",
      "start_ms": 368420,
      "end_ms": 369175,
      "text": "动容，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00143",
      "start_ms": 369680,
      "end_ms": 371055,
      "text": "请做三件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00144",
      "start_ms": 371880,
      "end_ms": 378340,
      "text": "点赞、收藏、转发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00145",
      "start_ms": 378460,
      "end_ms": 384795,
      "text": "让更多人看到评论区打上王成书三个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00146",
      "start_ms": 385720,
      "end_ms": 386500,
      "text": "这三个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00147",
      "start_ms": 386720,
      "end_ms": 388255,
      "text": "他低调了一辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00148",
      "start_ms": 389120,
      "end_ms": 392965,
      "text": "我们替他大声说一次关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00149",
      "start_ms": 393300,
      "end_ms": 395415,
      "text": "下一个国之脊梁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1b23700d23e01086_s00150",
      "start_ms": 395960,
      "end_ms": 396745,
      "text": "我们继续讲。"
    }
  ],
